    {
      "id":"constant-value-proof","source_numbers":["14"],
      "view":{"mode":"multiple","stem":"设 $P=\\frac{(a+b)^2}{ab}-\\frac{(a-b)^2}{ab}$，$Q=\\frac{(a+b)^2}{a^2+b^2}+\\frac{(a-b)^2}{a^2+b^2}$。每个式子都在自己的实数定义域中讨论。哪些计算过程完整正确？","figure_ids":[],"options":[
        {"id":"A","text":"当 $ab\\ne0$，$P=\\frac{a^2+2ab+b^2-(a^2-2ab+b^2)}{ab}=\\frac{4ab}{ab}=4$。","figure_ids":[]},
        {"id":"B","text":"当 $ab\\ne0$，$P=\\frac{a^2+2ab+b^2-a^2-2ab-b^2}{ab}=0$。","figure_ids":[]},
        {"id":"C","text":"当 $a^2+b^2\\ne0$，$Q=\\frac{a^2+2ab+b^2+a^2-2ab+b^2}{a^2+b^2}=\\frac{2(a^2+b^2)}{a^2+b^2}=2$。","figure_ids":[]},
        {"id":"D","text":"当 $a^2+b^2\\ne0$，$Q=\\frac{a^2+2ab+b^2+a^2+2ab+b^2}{a^2+b^2}=\\frac{2(a+b)^2}{a^2+b^2}$。","figure_ids":[]}
      ]},
      "intent":{"task":"逐步辨别两个常值证明的展开、外层减号、相消和合法约分。","source_solution":"(a+b)²-(a-b)²=4ab，P=4须ab非零；(a+b)²+(a-b)²=2(a²+b²)，Q=2须a、b不同时为零，允许一个为零。","unit_reason":"两个证明共用完全平方的和差，采用自然多选检查完整变形链，不在题干给恒值让学生反推分子。","concept_blocks":[9,12],"limitations":["不证明独立组织书面证明。"],"figure_observations":[]},
      "key":{"correct":["A","C"],"rationales":[
        {"option_id":"A","truth":"correct","derivation":"减去括号后交叉项2ab-(-2ab)=4ab，在ab非零时约分。","misconception":null},
        {"option_id":"B","truth":"incorrect","derivation":"展开第二平方后减去括号，-(-2ab)必须为+2ab，不能写-2ab；正确结果为4而非0。","misconception":"去掉外层减号括号时只改变首尾平方项的符号，未改变中间项的符号。"},
        {"option_id":"C","truth":"correct","derivation":"两平方相加的交叉项相消，剩2(a²+b²)；原分母非零即允许约分。","misconception":null},
        {"option_id":"D","truth":"incorrect","derivation":"第二平方(a-b)²的交叉项应-2ab；错误变成+2ab，a=b=1时给4而真实Q=2。","misconception":"把差的平方误展开成和的平方。"}
      ]}
    },
